WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.012
This applied query combines several ideas from the
module into one cohort

00:00:04.025 --> 00:00:09.975
rule The record must be active Consent must be
explicitly true which

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:14.650
means NULL consent is not treated as permission The
diagnosis must be

00:00:14.662 --> 00:00:20.112
either Diabetes or Kidney Disease Finally the email
field is normalized so

00:00:20.138 --> 00:00:25.662
NULL empty text and whitespace-only text all count
as unavailable Every condition

00:00:25.675 --> 00:00:30.275
is connected with AND because all requirements must
be satisfied Run the

00:00:30.300 --> 00:00:34.650
query and inspect the result Robert Lee is a useful
record because

00:00:34.675 --> 00:00:38.750
the diagnosis is Kidney Disease consent is true and
email is NULL

00:00:39.638 --> 00:00:43.100
Susan Gray has Kidney Disease but consent is unknown
so the row

00:00:43.125 --> 00:00:44.238
should not qualify
